Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design a cross-region, PCI-compliant streaming path with masking and robust DR. It probes data masking strategy, replication choice, and operational readiness.

Key Concepts
- Data masking in streaming CDC
- Cross-region replication and latency targets
- Encryption: TLS in transit, KMS at rest
- PITR window and RPO/RTO goals
- DR testing cadence and monitoring

Code Example
```javascript
// Simple masking example used in testing
function maskPII(value, field){
  if(!value) return null;
  switch(field){
    case 'ssn': return 'XXX-XX-' + value.slice(-4);
    case 'email': return '***@example.com';
    default: return 'REDACTED';
  }
}
```

Follow-up Questions
- How would you validate masking at scale across schema changes?
- What metrics and alarms would you configure for DR drills and replication lag?

Why This Is Asked
